      "narration": "Watch the green substrate approach the pocket in this large, folded enzyme. Notice how the neighboring domains surround that opening: the pocket is part of one connected protein. Compare the green substrate's outline with the cavity as it docks. Its shape fits without pushing through the surrounding fold. Now it withdraws, and the red substrate approaches the same pocket. Its extra projection meets the rim before it can fit. This schematic isolates shape compatibility; real specificity also depends on chemical interactions and protein flexibility.",
