      "captions": [
        {
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 5.4,
          "text": "Watch the green substrate approach the pocket in this large, folded enzyme."
        },
        {
          "start": 5.4,
          "end": 11,
          "text": "Notice how the neighboring domains surround that opening: the pocket is part of one"
        },
        {
          "start": 11,
          "end": 12.5,
          "text": "connected protein."
        },
        {
          "start": 12.5,
          "end": 16.9,
          "text": "Compare the green substrate's outline with the cavity as it docks."
        },
        {
          "start": 16.9,
          "end": 20.9,
          "text": "Its shape fits without pushing through the surrounding fold."
        },
        {
          "start": 20.9,
          "end": 25.366666666666667,
          "text": "Now it withdraws, and the red substrate approaches the same pocket."
        },
        {
          "start": 25.366666666666667,
          "end": 29.366666666666667,
          "text": "Its extra projection meets the rim before it can fit."
        },
        {
          "start": 29.366666666666667,
          "end": 34.5,
          "text": "This schematic isolates shape compatibility; real specificity also depends on"
        },
        {
          "start": 34.5,
          "end": 37.56666666666667,
          "text": "chemical interactions and protein flexibility."
        }
      ],
